+	 * 2-bit shift in all captured response bytes.  This manifests as
+	 * bits[7:5] = 0b110 (mask 0xE0 == 0xC0) on the first non-0xFF byte.
+	 * Decode in-place: actual[i] = (raw[i]<<2 | raw[i+1]>>6) & 0xFF */
